"""Self-test of the return validator: a gate that cannot fail is not a gate.

Every check id is exercised on input that must trip it, and the golden returns must
stay clean. Hermetic: each case builds its own fixture project in a temp directory.
The only thing taken from the real repository is the journey gate script, because the
point is to prove the validator against the gate projects actually run.
"""

